  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DYrMxGS/Lucky-Blocks-Race-2.png\"></h2><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span>又是一個簡單的賽跑，最後還有 PvP 對決</span></h4><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>資訊</strong></em>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>這張<strong>地圖</strong>支援&nbsp;<strong>2-4 位玩家！</strong></span><br><br><span>一張有趣的地圖，你的<strong>&nbsp;運氣</strong>&nbsp;將決定你的<strong>&nbsp;遊戲！</strong></span><br><span>和朋友<strong>&nbsp;競賽</strong>&nbsp;，看誰是<strong>&nbsp;最幸運的！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>在這張地圖中，你會發現一條充滿<strong>幸運方塊</strong>的賽道</span><br><span>要進入比賽，你<strong>必須按下按鈕</strong>，</span><br><span>抵達終點後，你會找到一個基地可以<strong>裝備自己</strong>，</span><br><span>然後進入<strong>PvP！</strong>&nbsp;最後存活的玩家將<strong>獲勝！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span>內含<strong>&nbsp;重生點</strong>&nbsp;，讓你玩起來不沮喪！</span><br><span>這張地圖適用於&nbsp;<strong>1.16.5 版本</strong></span><br><span>地圖中只包含經典的<strong>&nbsp;幸運方塊</strong>&nbsp;。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>模組版本：</strong>&nbsp;Lucky Block Forge 1.16.5-8.0 或更高版本</span><br><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>https://www.luckyblockmod.com/download</span><br><br></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>按此處可享 25% 折扣</span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"><br><br></a></h2><hr><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>作者：</strong></em></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"text-align:center\">El_this_boy</strong></h6><p style=\"text-align:center\">-&nbsp;<strong>Twitch</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy</a><br>-&nbsp;<strong>Twitter</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2</a><br>-&nbsp;<strong>Instagram</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://instagram.com/el_this_boy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://instagram.com/el_this_boy</a><br><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
